@startuml
title Deploy lifecycle — write to the validator, read back from the lagging observer
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

participant "Client (SDK)" as Client #D5EAF7
participant "Embers domain service" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "Validator\n(gRPC + WS)" as Val #FFE4A6
participant "Observer\n(HTTP explore-deploy)" as Obs #FFF1CC

Client -> Domain : signed deploy (send)

group Write path — deploy once, never retry
  Domain -> Val : do_deploy (gRPC, 30s deadline)
  Val --> Domain : deploy id
  Domain -> Val : wait_for_deploy (WS subscription)
  Val --> Domain : BlockFinalised\nSome(false)=ok / Some(true)=errored / None=timeout
end

group Read path — postcondition, retry only on empty
  Domain -> Obs : explore-deploy (read the postcondition)
  alt observer still lagging: visibility < finality
    Obs --> Domain : empty (ReturnValueMissing)
    Domain -> Domain : backoff <latex>w_i</latex>, retry\nbudget <latex>T \geq 2\,t_{req}</latex> = 150s
    Domain -> Obs : explore-deploy (retry)
  end
  Obs --> Domain : value (now visible)
end

Domain --> Client : SendResp / readback

note over Val, Obs #FFF0C7
Finality (validator) and visibility (observer) are separate events;
visibility lag <latex>L(d) = t_{vis}(d) - t_{fin}(d) \geq 0</latex>.
A read observes d iff <latex>L(d) \leq T</latex>. See ObserverConsistency.tla.
end note
@enduml
